  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v0.9.6 — Quality, stability, and safety improvements\n\nAdded:\n- Unit test suite (65 tests) covering InputStateMachine and DiffService\n- Empty response recovery — helpful message instead of blank screen on context overflow\n- Rendering timeout guard with spinner — prevents permanent freezes on large responses\n\nFixed:\n- Timeout retry deadlock — timeouts no longer silently retry for up to 15 minutes\n- Silent exception suppression — 6 bare catch blocks now log to Debug\n- Shell command safety — uses ArgumentList instead of manual string escaping\n- Config validation consistency — maxTokens enforces [256, 131072] everywhere",
